{"id":"n34734-4-5","stage":0,"title":"끝나다 · 下课","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n34734-4-5-1","ko":"오늘 회사 끝나고 뭐 해?","zh":"今天下班后打算做什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나고","meaning":"下课，下班","explanation":"끝나다：下课，下班；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나고","audio":"/audio/02bfa899d696ea03947a.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"해?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio"